	(footprint "Jolla_JP2601_TOH_Contact_7P_P2.90mm_Pads"
		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "fe6563de-c858-4a64-80de-a2f3f8f3ec79")
		(at 80.2 91.55)
		(descr "Jolla Phone (2026) JP2601 The Other Half: cover-side contact pads. The PHONE has the spring-loaded pogo pins; the cover only needs 7 flat pads (like Jolla's own covers), 2.90 mm pitch; no screw hole (the board is held by the cover, like Jolla's own). Drawn as seen from behind the phone (= from the cover PCB's top side). The contact pads are SMD on B.Cu (the board's bottom faces the phone), so the footprint is placed on the front without flipping. Route each pad to wire/solder pads elsewhere. Use ENIG or hard gold. Origin = pin 1. Pad diameter 2.3 mm as on Jolla's Inari Blue cover (measured; phone pin tips are 0.9 mm). Positions from docs.sailfishos.org/Develop/Hardware/JP2601-TOH (JP2601_Back_Drawings.png).")
		(tags "jolla jp2601 toh contact pad 2.90mm")
